WEBVTT

00:08.200 --> 00:14.990
-The Mourner's Eyes-

01:32.610 --> 01:36.990
Episode 6

01:41.520 --> 01:45.370
Hey, Brother, did you get
what the College wanted?

01:45.370 --> 01:47.380
I've already handed it over
to the special forces.

01:47.380 --> 01:49.500
They'll get it to the College
through confidential channels.

01:49.500 --> 01:50.330
I see.

01:50.660 --> 01:53.420
Also, according to the plan, we have
to rush to the airport immediately.

01:53.420 --> 01:54.800
Our flight is at midnight.

01:54.800 --> 01:57.300
Oh, right. I forgot that we have
to return to the College tonight.

01:57.300 --> 01:59.010
I need to go back and get my passport.

01:59.010 --> 02:00.590
But, my passport...

02:00.590 --> 02:02.910
The special forces have already
picked up your things.

02:02.910 --> 02:05.060
They'll give them to you at the airport.

02:05.060 --> 02:06.140
Okay...

02:15.010 --> 02:18.150
Brother, your injury seems
to be healing quickly.

02:18.150 --> 02:20.720
Blood Rage accelerates
cellular regeneration,

02:20.720 --> 02:22.240
so this injury shouldn't be a problem.

02:22.240 --> 02:23.910
What is Blood Rage?

02:23.910 --> 02:28.040
It's a technique that instantly enhances
a bloodline through spiritual cultivation.

02:28.040 --> 02:32.390
Even a hybrid can use
Blood Rage to briefly gain strength

02:32.390 --> 02:34.960
nearly on par with a pure-blooded dragon.

02:34.960 --> 02:38.220
It's very useful on dragon-slaying missions.

02:38.640 --> 02:39.620
I see.

02:40.350 --> 02:42.850
Hey, do you need me to help you inside?

02:42.850 --> 02:44.430
No, I'm fine.

02:53.640 --> 02:55.470
Although your injuries have healed,

02:56.040 --> 02:59.580
you still look tired, Brother.

03:03.020 --> 03:04.990
Are these the only options around here?

03:05.360 --> 03:06.990
They'll have to do.

03:54.500 --> 03:56.190
My body should be fine,

03:56.800 --> 03:58.340
and there are no signs of scarring.

03:59.250 --> 04:02.290
My internal organs feel good too,
so everything should be fine.

04:04.270 --> 04:05.390
But this...

04:05.390 --> 04:08.470
This the shard of glass that
got stuck in me during the fight...

04:09.160 --> 04:10.920
I should be able to remove it.

04:15.310 --> 04:17.310
My blood is highly corrosive,

04:17.630 --> 04:19.140
so it can't let any drip in this room.

04:32.770 --> 04:34.210
I don't look any different,

04:35.600 --> 04:38.040
just a little pale.

04:50.500 --> 04:54.130
In this house, I'm a different person:

04:55.410 --> 04:56.690
a good student,

04:57.200 --> 05:01.000
obedient, one who loves playing
basketball and reading,

05:01.570 --> 05:04.530
with no bad habits or violent tendencies.

05:05.120 --> 05:07.180
I'm the "model son"
my parents are proud of.

05:07.980 --> 05:12.080
If they saw these bloody things,
they probably wouldn't be so proud.

05:13.680 --> 05:15.710
They would think they had raised a monster.

05:32.910 --> 05:35.230
I guess I won't have time to say
goodbye before I go.

05:35.920 --> 05:40.490
Mom is just like that,
dead to the world in her sleep.

05:41.020 --> 05:43.920
Zihang, are you back?

05:43.920 --> 05:46.400
Huh? Are you leaving?

05:46.400 --> 05:48.740
Yes, I have a night flight.

05:48.740 --> 05:51.050
Why didn't you tell your parents?

05:51.050 --> 05:54.040
We could've had dinner together
and let the driver take you.

05:54.040 --> 05:57.410
I told them yesterday that
Dad is busy tonight.

05:57.410 --> 06:01.950
That's right. Your dad is also having
dinner with a business partner tonight.

06:01.950 --> 06:05.320
Don't let my mom sleep in the living
room in the future. She'll catch a cold.

06:05.320 --> 06:09.120
I didn't, she was just
cooking in the kitchen

06:09.120 --> 06:10.800
and asked me to buy
vinegar at the supermarket.

06:10.800 --> 06:12.300
When I came back, she was asleep.

06:12.300 --> 06:13.560
Cooking?

06:13.560 --> 06:14.850
Oh, no!

06:15.540 --> 06:16.860
Huh? What...

06:18.280 --> 06:19.690
Oh, Zihang...

06:25.690 --> 06:27.320
Are you okay?

06:29.710 --> 06:31.120
What is this?

06:31.120 --> 06:33.280
This... This looks like...

06:33.280 --> 06:36.040
Oh, I see, your mom was making dumplings!

06:36.040 --> 06:36.790
Dumplings?

06:36.790 --> 06:37.540
Yes.

06:37.540 --> 06:39.880
Your mom must have thought you
were going on a long trip,

06:39.880 --> 06:42.040
so she wanted to make dumplings for you.

06:55.280 --> 06:56.870
It can't be eaten anymore.

06:56.870 --> 06:58.080
Let's just throw it away.

07:01.260 --> 07:02.270
All right.

07:02.270 --> 07:05.520
Aunt Tong, remember to buy this
low-fat milk for my mom every day.

07:05.520 --> 07:07.190
She won't drink anything else.

07:07.190 --> 07:10.480
Add a sugar cube and microwave
on low for five minutes.

07:10.480 --> 07:12.490
Make sure she drinks it
every night before bed.

07:12.490 --> 07:14.030
Yes, I know.

07:14.030 --> 07:15.750
Same as always.

07:17.710 --> 07:18.550
I'm leaving.

07:19.050 --> 07:20.750
Aren't you going to say goodbye to your mom?

07:20.750 --> 07:22.540
I'm not used to saying goodbye.

07:22.540 --> 07:25.920
Every time she sees me off,
she gives me a big kiss.

07:36.210 --> 07:37.260
Come in.

07:40.310 --> 07:44.150
Master, the principal said you
might need something to drink.

07:44.500 --> 07:47.500
The principal called me
here for the board meeting.

07:48.160 --> 07:49.400
Is everyone here?

07:49.400 --> 07:51.200
The last one has just arrived.

07:56.340 --> 07:57.850
The last one?

07:58.620 --> 08:02.160
There are seven board members,
so one must be missing.

08:02.160 --> 08:04.540
I've never seen the last one in attendance,

08:04.540 --> 08:06.290
and I don't know his name.

08:06.290 --> 08:08.670
His identity is top secret.

08:10.080 --> 08:12.830
They spend loads of money
on the College every year,

08:12.830 --> 08:15.010
but they never exercise their authority.

08:15.010 --> 08:18.070
These board members are really interesting.

08:18.070 --> 08:20.970
The board members didn't invest
in Cassel College for the money.

08:20.970 --> 08:23.980
So, why did they do it, then?

08:23.980 --> 08:28.230
They've all come this far on the blood
of dragons, and their goals are...

08:28.930 --> 08:30.360
far-reaching.

08:32.190 --> 08:35.360
Are they also members of this generation's
secret party, the Council of Elders?

08:35.360 --> 08:37.840
No. The Council of Elders
is a hidden organization,

08:37.840 --> 08:40.080
and the school board is a visible one.

08:40.080 --> 08:43.750
The principal is the executive
chosen by the school board.

08:43.750 --> 08:47.250
So the Council of Elders is
still the highest authority?

08:47.250 --> 08:48.510
Not necessarily.

08:48.510 --> 08:51.130
The Council of Elders and the school board
are like Yingguo's upper and lower houses.

08:51.440 --> 08:54.420
Who holds the power depends
on the situation.

08:54.420 --> 08:57.630
Right now, power is indeed concentrated
in the hands of the principal,

08:57.630 --> 09:00.180
who also has significant influence
over the school board.

09:01.950 --> 09:05.160
So, facing these powerful people,

09:05.160 --> 09:06.980
am I supposed to just wait here?

09:06.980 --> 09:08.900
Wait for them to call me in?

09:09.220 --> 09:12.640
Today, all the powerful
people are here for you.

09:12.640 --> 09:14.280
They can't wait to see you.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.600
Powerful people...

09:35.350 --> 09:38.660
Now that everyone is present,

09:38.660 --> 09:43.960
we will officially begin this year's annual
meeting of the Cassel College school board.

09:52.190 --> 09:56.960
Frost, there's no need to continue with the
old tradition of tapping on the table to speak.

09:56.960 --> 09:58.820
This is an internal meeting.

09:58.820 --> 10:02.900
Some rules can't be changed arbitrarily.

10:02.900 --> 10:05.160
Is the Bronze Report ready?

10:05.160 --> 10:08.790
Yes, it's the stack of papers
in front of each of you.

10:13.050 --> 10:17.800
The Emperor of Bronze and Flames... is dead?

10:23.380 --> 10:28.790
Dead? Anjou, is this report true?

10:28.790 --> 10:32.650
No one has ever verified the
death of a Dragon Emperor.

10:32.650 --> 10:34.370
Absolutely true.

10:34.370 --> 10:36.570
Please present the evidence.

10:39.490 --> 10:42.570
The evidence is in this box.

10:42.570 --> 10:44.870
Everyone is free to examine it.

10:44.870 --> 10:46.560
I'll do it.

10:49.370 --> 10:51.080
The Philosopher's Stone?

10:51.630 --> 10:54.590
The great miracle of alchemy,
the Philosopher's Stone?

10:54.590 --> 10:57.510
Anjou, what do you mean by presenting it?

10:57.510 --> 11:00.340
Evidence. Evidence that
the Dragon Emperor is dead.

11:00.340 --> 11:03.760
No way. The Philosopher's Stone is precious,

11:03.760 --> 11:05.640
but it doesn't prove anything.

11:05.640 --> 11:08.600
Maybe someone else can explain
it more convincingly.

11:08.600 --> 11:11.360
Charlotte, you're an expert in alchemy.

11:11.360 --> 11:13.400
Would you mind explaining it to everyone?

11:13.400 --> 11:14.490
Sure.

11:15.730 --> 11:18.800
The Philosopher's Stone is the
crystallization of spiritual elements.

11:18.800 --> 11:20.370
Because it contains impurities,

11:20.370 --> 11:23.280
it usually appears as a
dark, coarse crystal.

11:23.280 --> 11:25.860
This object may resemble
the Philosopher's Stone,

11:25.860 --> 11:29.320
but it's actually another substance
refined from pure fire elements.

11:29.320 --> 11:31.750
Please explain how to
refine pure fire elements.

11:31.750 --> 11:35.790
The only method I know for refining the four
elements of earth, water, wind, and fire

11:35.790 --> 11:38.760
is to use the bones of the
corresponding dragon kings.

11:38.760 --> 11:44.010
Therefore, this fire element was refined from
the bones of the Emperor of Bronze and Flames.

11:44.010 --> 11:46.500
Dragon Emperor Norton.

11:46.500 --> 11:47.390
Not Norton,

11:47.390 --> 11:50.980
but his brother, the
Dragon Emperor Constantine.

11:51.340 --> 11:56.160
Crystals made from Constantine's bones?

11:56.160 --> 12:00.710
Anjou, are you saying that
Constantine is permanently dead?

12:00.710 --> 12:02.950
He'll never be resurrected?

12:05.800 --> 12:08.140
The Dragon Emperor's
resurrection is a secret,

12:08.140 --> 12:10.830
and unfortunately, I can't
share it with everyone yet.

12:10.830 --> 12:12.600
But according to my research,

12:12.600 --> 12:14.700
only after a Dragon Emperor is truly dead

12:14.700 --> 12:17.200
can his bones be used as
material for refinement.

12:17.200 --> 12:19.630
Otherwise, they're just specimens.

12:19.630 --> 12:21.850
Your research?

12:21.850 --> 12:26.140
Anjou, how do you prove your point?

12:26.140 --> 12:29.250
Yes, my words alone won't convince you.

12:29.250 --> 12:32.560
But Charlotte, you should
be able to vouch for me.

12:35.460 --> 12:36.330
Hm...

12:39.480 --> 12:41.030
Anjou is right.

12:41.030 --> 12:42.780
The Dragon Emperor Constantine...

12:43.640 --> 12:45.000
is truly dead.

13:00.580 --> 13:04.010
So, Anjou, you've found a
way to kill a Dragon Emperor.

13:04.010 --> 13:06.510
Can this method be used
on other Dragon Emperors?

13:06.510 --> 13:10.680
Of course, but the process
is still quite challenging.

13:10.680 --> 13:13.360
The Emperor of Bronze and Flames
has been proven to be a set of twins.

13:13.360 --> 13:15.940
Does this mean all four emperors are twins?

13:15.940 --> 13:17.410
That should be the case.

13:17.410 --> 13:22.400
The key point: where are Constantine's
remains currently kept?

13:22.400 --> 13:23.360
In a secure location.

13:23.360 --> 13:25.170
A location you deem secure,

13:25.170 --> 13:27.490
or one we all deem secure?

13:28.950 --> 13:33.370
Let's put it this way: only two people in
the entire world can access them.

13:33.370 --> 13:34.250
And who are they?

13:34.250 --> 13:36.830
Me, and the person who built the vault.

13:37.830 --> 13:42.950
So, among us, you're the only one who
can access the Dragon Emperor's remains.

13:42.950 --> 13:45.300
Is that right, Mr. Principal?

13:45.300 --> 13:46.010
That's right.

13:46.010 --> 13:48.130
Cassel College doesn't belong to you.

13:48.130 --> 13:50.220
You are merely the manager we put in place.

13:50.220 --> 13:51.740
I think I manage it quite well.

13:51.010 --> 13:51.740
So?!

13:51.740 --> 13:53.350
So you should trust me.

13:53.350 --> 13:54.800
I agree with Anjou.

13:54.800 --> 13:58.270
He has demonstrated strong leadership
on all previous missions.

13:58.270 --> 14:02.650
An expert dragon slayer and an excellent
manager are two different things.

14:02.650 --> 14:03.830
None of this matters.

14:03.830 --> 14:06.030
Our goal is the Dragon Emperors.
Nothing else matters!

14:06.030 --> 14:08.150
The dragon bones should be given to
the school board for safekeeping!

14:08.150 --> 14:10.310
They are a treasure.

14:10.310 --> 14:14.700
If I hand them over to the school board,
what will you, the Gattuso family, do with them?

14:14.700 --> 14:16.750
Watch your tongue, Anjou!

14:16.750 --> 14:19.140
I'm speaking for the school board,

14:19.140 --> 14:20.710
not the Gattuso family!

14:22.100 --> 14:27.400
Yes, Mr. Frost, you can fire me
on behalf of the school board.

14:27.400 --> 14:30.970
But until then, I won't turn
the dragon bones over to you.

14:30.970 --> 14:33.010
Anjou! You're overstepping your authority!

14:33.010 --> 14:35.680
Who should keep the dragon bones
is not on today's agenda!

14:35.680 --> 14:38.270
But it's true that only the school board
has the authority to dispose of them!

14:38.270 --> 14:41.540
Coup! Anjou, you're throwing a coup!

14:40.020 --> 14:41.540
Let's end this topic.

14:41.540 --> 14:44.000
Compared to the great cause of dragon slaying,
these are trivial matters!

14:43.150 --> 14:46.280
Calm down! This is school board meeting!

14:45.030 --> 14:47.440
Regardless, the dragon bones
belong to the school board!

15:07.300 --> 15:10.590
This issue won't reach a
conclusion, so let's end it here.

15:12.090 --> 15:13.820
You can't fire me,

15:14.560 --> 15:17.970
because you can't find anyone to replace me.

15:17.970 --> 15:21.630
Indeed, no one has been able
to replace Anjou thus far.

15:21.630 --> 15:22.950
Besides the students,

15:22.950 --> 15:25.480
he also has the absolute support
of the execution bureau's elite.

15:25.860 --> 15:26.780
Thank you.

15:30.640 --> 15:34.490
Anjou, let's put aside the ownership
of the dragon bones for now.

15:34.890 --> 15:38.610
This is a letter from
the Council of Elders to you,

15:38.610 --> 15:41.420
expressing their ideas about the future.

15:41.420 --> 15:42.750
A love letter?

15:44.490 --> 15:49.010
But since the future hasn't arrived yet,
you can read it later.

15:49.920 --> 15:53.150
Since it's not a love letter,
there's no rush to read it.

15:53.760 --> 15:56.810
All right, let's move on to the next topic:

15:56.810 --> 15:58.890
the selection of candidates
for the Nibelungen Plan.

16:24.990 --> 16:28.760
Mr. Caesar Gattuso.

16:31.090 --> 16:35.350
Mr. Caesar Gattuso has just been unanimously
re-elected as student council president.

16:35.350 --> 16:38.000
His GPA is 2.7, which is a bit low,

16:38.000 --> 16:40.790
similar to the former president's
university grades.

16:40.790 --> 16:42.490
He once received a warning for

16:42.490 --> 16:45.520
organizing a beer swimming competition
in the pool during winter,

16:45.520 --> 16:47.060
causing the pool to freeze and crack.

16:47.870 --> 16:49.410
I wanted to use champagne,

16:49.410 --> 16:52.190
but it was difficult to buy so many
bottles of the same brand at once.

16:52.190 --> 16:54.490
There's only one reason he's sitting here:

16:55.000 --> 16:58.280
he killed Dragon Emperor Norton.

17:05.920 --> 17:09.670
Caesar, I'm sorry I can't reveal
the names of all the board members.

17:09.670 --> 17:11.250
Except for your uncle.

17:11.250 --> 17:14.220
Oh, right. Aren't you going
to say hello to your uncle?

17:14.560 --> 17:19.430
I wasn't summoned here because a
Gattuso is on the board, was I?

17:19.430 --> 17:23.310
You were summoned because
of the Nibelungen Plan.

17:23.580 --> 17:25.440
Nibelungen?

17:25.440 --> 17:27.590
The "Land of the Dead" in Norse mythology?

17:27.590 --> 17:29.440
Why such a code name?

17:29.440 --> 17:31.710
The Bronze City is Nibelungen,

17:31.710 --> 17:35.950
and you, Caesar, faced Dragon
Emperor Norton in that battle.

17:35.950 --> 17:37.490
What was it like?

17:46.530 --> 17:47.580
Fear!

17:48.880 --> 17:50.940
Fear that penetrated to the bone.

17:51.880 --> 17:53.540
You speak the truth.

17:53.540 --> 17:55.760
There is no better way
to train a dragon slayer

17:55.760 --> 17:58.470
than have one experience
fear on the battlefield.

17:58.470 --> 18:02.000
Only the strongest will
and the finest bloodline

18:02.000 --> 18:05.600
can maintain dignity before the
Dragon Emperor and ultimately slay him!

18:05.600 --> 18:06.390
So?

18:06.390 --> 18:09.750
So, Cassel College must immediately
train the elite of the elite,

18:09.750 --> 18:11.230
the heroes of heroes.

18:11.230 --> 18:13.980
Because the most critical
moment is approaching.

18:13.980 --> 18:15.990
The most critical moment?

18:15.990 --> 18:21.490
Mythology has foretold that the Dragon Emperors
on the other three thrones will awaken.

18:21.490 --> 18:26.520
And finally, the great
black dragon will awaken.

18:28.120 --> 18:30.000
A mass awakening?

18:31.170 --> 18:33.170
How exciting.

18:33.590 --> 18:36.260
We must prepare our army
and generals before then.

18:36.260 --> 18:40.510
We must select the best candidates
from those with superior bloodlines

18:40.510 --> 18:43.120
and devote all our efforts to their training.

18:43.120 --> 18:44.390
Are you talking about me?

18:44.390 --> 18:46.270
You're one of the candidates.

18:46.270 --> 18:51.360
If by "devoting all our efforts to training,"
you mean giving me more classes and training,

18:51.360 --> 18:52.370
then forget it.

18:53.120 --> 18:54.720
My GPA is only 2.7.

18:54.720 --> 18:55.770
No.

18:56.280 --> 18:59.610
What we need to strengthen is your bloodline.

18:59.610 --> 19:01.710
With a strengthened bloodline,

19:01.710 --> 19:04.790
it's possible to possess two or more Yanlings,

19:04.790 --> 19:07.700
and even hybrids can surpass Dragon Emperors.

19:07.700 --> 19:09.620
They can rival the Four Dragon Emperors?

19:09.620 --> 19:13.920
That's right! This is the Nibelungen Plan.

19:13.920 --> 19:18.810
The Council of Elders have already found
a way to strengthen the bloodline.

19:18.810 --> 19:21.190
This is a tremendous gift.

19:21.190 --> 19:24.600
Accepting it means gaining power,

19:24.600 --> 19:27.220
but it also means a great sacrifice.

19:27.220 --> 19:30.640
Caesar, are you willing?

19:31.640 --> 19:34.480
Why does this feel a bit like... wedding vows?

19:34.480 --> 19:35.360
Caesar!

19:35.360 --> 19:37.840
Enduring hardships and
dying is nothing special.

19:37.840 --> 19:40.490
If that's what it takes to
reach the pinnacle of hybrids,

19:40.490 --> 19:42.490
there are lots of people at
the College who'd be willing to accept.

19:42.490 --> 19:43.870
Why choose me?

19:43.870 --> 19:45.280
Because you're good enough.

19:45.280 --> 19:46.490
Why not Chu Zihang?

19:46.490 --> 19:48.040
He has no experience in
slaying Dragon Emperors.

19:48.040 --> 19:49.410
Why not Lu Mingfei?

19:49.410 --> 19:50.900
Mingfei is still a newcomer,

19:50.900 --> 19:54.330
and many still think it was my
mistake to give him an S-Rank.

19:54.330 --> 19:57.760
But he once severely wounded
Dragon Emperor Constantine in front of you.

19:57.760 --> 20:00.840
Principal, you might randomly give S-Ranks,

20:00.840 --> 20:02.660
but in close combat with a Dragon Emperor,

20:02.660 --> 20:05.600
I don't believe you'd entrust
your life to a worthless person.

20:05.600 --> 20:08.470
So, that reasoning doesn't hold up.

20:08.470 --> 20:10.480
Hm... You're right.

20:10.480 --> 20:14.900
For this candidate, your uncle insisted
that ability isn't just about bloodline,

20:14.900 --> 20:16.530
but also about leadership.

20:16.530 --> 20:20.190
Among the new generation, Caesar,
you're indeed a brilliant leader.

20:20.190 --> 20:22.320
Even Chu Zihang can't compare,

20:22.320 --> 20:23.860
so your uncle believes that

20:23.860 --> 20:27.330
only you deserve to be the top
candidate for the Nibelungen Plan.

20:31.580 --> 20:34.910
Caesar, do you understand now?

20:34.910 --> 20:39.420
Your family has always had
selfless love and hope for you!

20:43.730 --> 20:44.640
Uncle,

20:45.840 --> 20:48.470
have you ever lost the most
important person in your life?

20:48.470 --> 20:49.390
Huh?

20:49.390 --> 20:51.280
Oh, I forgot.

20:51.280 --> 20:55.350
People like you, Uncle, don't have
anyone important in their lives.

20:55.350 --> 20:57.930
So, you wouldn't understand

20:57.930 --> 21:02.240
that people who have experienced such things
often become particularly stubborn.

21:02.240 --> 21:03.580
Sorry, everyone.

21:03.580 --> 21:06.450
I refuse your offer.

21:06.450 --> 21:07.990
Caesar! You...

21:07.990 --> 21:10.870
If there's nothing else,
I will take my leave.

21:25.660 --> 21:26.510
What's this?

21:26.510 --> 21:29.970
Ah, I figured since you'd been on a mission,

21:29.970 --> 21:31.260
you haven't had dinner.

21:31.260 --> 21:33.260
So I bought some food nearby,

21:33.260 --> 21:36.140
but at this hour,
all I could get was hamburgers.

21:36.140 --> 21:37.600
You got these for me?

21:38.500 --> 21:39.980
Let's eat together on the way.

21:42.400 --> 21:43.170
Thanks.

22:01.860 --> 22:03.160
Zihang...

22:04.170 --> 22:05.940
Have a safe trip.
